      "writtenOn": "2025-02-24T23:00:38Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Thanks for the pointer. While I would like to fix this and add the internal cross-references, it\u0027s a bit of an experimental idea right now and I don\u0027t want to necessarily commit to it at this moment. Can ONNX call Destroy explicitly?",
      "parentUuid": "bd1ddd92_05fe1218",
      "revId": "2cadde649e9f5f37510060c4f3108457033c4620",
      "serverId": "dd02978d-1a8e-36d7-bcc0-a5723e5c0abd"
